WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.067
A quick tour of the app.

00:00:02.767 --> 00:00:11.400
My day. Every morning starts here: your appointments, follow-ups due, new requests, jobs waiting on a permit and who is on site.

00:00:11.900 --> 00:00:22.233
Search everything. Type a name, phone, street or an EST-, JOB- or INV- number. ⌘K jumps here from any screen.

00:00:22.733 --> 00:00:28.900
Ask for help any time. Tell it what you want to do and it shows you, step by step, like this.

00:00:29.400 --> 00:00:37.433
Customers. Every customer and lead. One screen each: phones, addresses, notes, estimates, jobs, invoices.

00:00:37.933 --> 00:00:43.800
Estimates. Every estimate and its follow-ups. Won ones become jobs in one step.

00:00:44.300 --> 00:00:50.833
Schedule. Crews down the side, days across. Drag work onto a crew; drag it again to move it.

00:00:51.333 --> 00:00:56.333
Invoices. Bills, payments, card declines and month-end billing.

00:00:56.833 --> 00:01:01.600
The Guide. Every how-to in one place. Each one has a tour like this.

00:01:02.100 --> 00:01:07.700
That's it. You can play this tour in the app any time: press Help, and ask in your own words.
